7329:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7330:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7331:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_DIRECTTI: TIM Input 2 is selected to be connected to IC2.
